    "created_at": "2024-02-21T10:56:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-02-21T10:56:40Z",
    "body": "Config composition has been proposed in the past, and I wouldn't mind accepting something like that. There is a stalled effort in https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/1887, but the code has unresolved issues. Extending the default search path alongside such a feature would probably be fine.\r\n\r\nThat said, I'm not sure if it's a good idea to recommend shipping starship-extensions without more effort into making the user experience around custom modules better.",
